        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsangī mu kūntūmamīla Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū badūgū bane, ū nene nakalemeelwa ū kūmusomboolela gītī banhū ba nhūngwa ja Kiimoyo, nūgelela kūmusomboolela gītī banhū ba nhūngwa ja mīlī dūhū; gītī banīgīnī ū mulī Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakang'winha mabeele, ītī shilīwa shitimbu yaya; nguno ī shene ng'walī mutaalī ū kūdūla ū kūshilya, hama nīyo nī haha mutaalī ū kūshidūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mutaalī ba nhūngwa ja mīlī; ī gīsī ūlū būlīho wilu na wilemeelwa ū mu bing'we, numho mutī ba nhūngwa ja mīlī, gīt'ūmo balī banhū bangī dūhū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū būlī ng'wene akūhayaga gīkī, “Ū nene nalī wa ng'wa Paulo,” na ūngī, “Ū nene nalī wa ng'wa Apolo;” angū, numho mutī banhū ba nhūngwa ja mīlī ī gīko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū Apolo ni nani, nū Paulo nang'hwe nani? Tūhaya a benabo batūmami dūhū abo mukazunya mu nzīla yabo, nīyo būlī ng'wene alī na kinhīlwe kakwe kūfuma kūlī Seeba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakahamba, ū Apolo wiza kwitīīla minzī, alīyo ū Mulungu hū ng'wene ūyo akajikūjaga ī mbīyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya ū ng'hambi nū ng'witīīji wa minzī, batī na gwabo ūlū atī Mulungu, ūyo akakūjaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū ng'hambi nū ng'witīīji batikīlile; būlī ng'wene akwanukūla mheela yakwe gīt'ūmo galī a matwajo gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, a bise tūlī batūmami biye ba ng'wa Mulungu, a bing'we mulī ngūnda gokwe; mulī nzenga ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ū mu būdūla bo kinhīlwe ako Mulungu anigabīlile gītī ntaale wa bazengi, nakatūūla nsingi; alīyo ūngī akūzengaga a higūlya yago; nose hū kūhaya būlī ng'wene ūyo akūzengaga a higūlya yago ni ilang'hanage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo adūgije kūtūūla nsingi gūngī, kūleka ūyo gūtūūlilwe ho na kale; ū nsingi gwenūyo ng'wene Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ūlū ose ose ūzengela zahabu a ha nsingi gwenūyo, nūūlū feza, nūūlū mawe ga mpango, nūūlū mitī, nūūlū mbelele, nūūlū maswa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būlī ng'wene gūkūmanīka ū nīmo gokwe. Nguno ū lūshikū lwenūlo lūkūgoolecha hape, īkī lūkūbiza lo moto. Ū moto hū gwene ūyo gūkoolecha ūmo gūlī gete būlī nīmo go ng'wa munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ose ose ūlū gūpūlūgūka ū nīmo ūyo alasangwe wagūzengela ho, akwanukūla mheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ose ose ūyo nīmo gokwe gūkūnogotela akūbiza wajimīīja, ahene ū wei akūpīla; gwike gītī bo kūpūlūgūka kūfuma mu moto! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we, mutamanile gīkī mulī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, nī gīkī ū Moyo wa ng'wa Mulungu akikalaga mu bing'we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ose ose ūyo wīkenaagūla ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, nang'hwe ū Mulungu akūnkenaagūla ū munhū ng'wenūyo, nguno ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu īlī neela; h'a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizigela munhū wa kwilemba ng'wenekīlī; ūlū alīho ose ose mu bing'we ūyo akibonaga gīkī alī na masala ū mu shikū īji, ni ibalage kūbiza nchilū chilū, h'abize na masala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a masala ga mu sī galī būchilū chilū ū kūlī Mulungu; gīt'ūmo gwandīkilwe gīkī, “Ū wei akabagwashaga a ba masala mu masala gabo;” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na hangī gīkī, “Ū Seeba agamanile a maganiko ga ba masala, gīkī gatikīlile na gūdūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya gīkī, munhū ose ose atizikumīlīja kūlwa banhū, nguno pyī ī shikolo shilī shing'we; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abize Paulo, nūūlū Apolo, nūūlū Kefa, nūūlū sī, nūūlū būpanga. Pyī nī licha, nī shisho shilīho ī haha, nī shisho shikūbiza ho ū mu shikū ja kū būtongi; shose pye shilī shing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a bing'we mulī ba ng'wa Kilisito, ū Kilisito nang'hwe wa ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
